WEBVTT

00:00:01.049 --> 00:00:04.886
Percy: Gryffindors, follow me, please.
Keep up. Thank you.

00:00:05.053 --> 00:00:09.391
Ravenclaw, follow me. This way.

00:00:09.683 --> 00:00:13.019
Percy: This is the most direct path
to the dormitories.

00:00:13.228 --> 00:00:17.399
Keep an eye on the staircases.
They like to change.

00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:32.330
Keep up, please, and follow me.
Quickly now, come on. Come on.

00:00:32.539 --> 00:00:35.208
Ron: That picture's moving.

00:00:35.417 --> 00:00:38.920
Ron: Look at that one.
Harry: I think she fancies you.

00:00:40.672 --> 00:00:43.008
Girl 1: Look!
Girl 2: Who's that girl?

00:00:43.216 --> 00:00:45.760
Man in picture:
Welcome to Hogwarts.

00:00:47.429 --> 00:00:48.513
Girl 3: Who's that?

00:01:01.776 --> 00:01:03.361
Password?

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:06.615
Caput draconis.

00:01:13.371 --> 00:01:18.251
Percy: Follow me, everyone.
Keep up. Quickly, come on.

00:01:20.962 --> 00:01:23.381
Gather around here.

00:01:25.091 --> 00:01:28.386
Welcome to the Gryffindor
common room.

00:01:28.595 --> 00:01:32.974
Boys' dormitory is upstairs to the left.
Girls, the same on your right.

00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:36.353
Your belongings have
already been brought up.

